ID: f680aba6-8839-4c1c-85d6-2f6b9292a830
Comment: `validateAdditionalAttributes()` treats a string of spaces as valid input because it only checks for `null`/`""`. If a mandatory token attribute is left as whitespace, the form will still submit, which seems to bypass the new validation entirely.

