ID: fef0dff5-2e09-4511-bd6a-414167180c1a
Comment: Using `withCount(['fields', 'models'])` on the query is a necessary improvement over `all()`. It eagerly calculates the `_count` attributes, preventing N+1 queries and ensuring `$fieldset->fields_count` and `$fieldset->models_count` are reliably populated when passed to the transformer.

