Comment: In `verifyContentLanguage.BeforeWrite` (gcsblob_test.go), the `var objp` declaration and `as(&objp)` check are now dead code since the `ObjectHandle` manipulation was removed. Consider removing this boilerplate entirely. A dedicated test (`TestPreconditions`) already covers `ObjectHandle` exposure, so leaving vestigial `As` calls in a content-language verifier adds unnecessary noise.

